### **Migration Safety**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Production-safe migrations
class Migration(migrations.Migration):
    atomic = False  # For large data migrations
    
    operations = [
        # Add field as nullable first
        migrations.AddField(
            model_name='episode',
            name='new_field',
            field=models.CharField(max_length=100, null=True),
        ),
        # Populate data in separate operation
        migrations.RunPython(populate_new_field, reverse_code=migrations.RunPython.noop),
        # Make non-nullable after population
        migrations.AlterField(
            model_name='episode',
            name='new_field',
            field=models.CharField(max_length=100),
        ),
    ]
```

